### API Endpoints

#### Subscriptions

    POST /api/subscriptions
        Create a subscription for a user in the Dexie Cloud database.

    GET /api/subscriptions/{id}
        Get the specified subscription from Dexie Cloud.

    DELETE /api/subscriptions/{id}
        Delete the specified subscription from Dexie Cloud.

#### Notifications

    POST /api/notifications/{user}
        Send a notification to the specified user

#### Vapid key

    GET /api/vapid-key
        Gets the configured public vapid key

#### Notify

    POST /api/notify
        Gets all subscriptions from Dexie Cloud and sends a "Hello, world!" message to everyone.
